{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111887","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111887/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111887/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111887/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111887","id":3537670951,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7S3JMn","number":111887,"title":"Exported variable with setter in Resource resets to default value","user":{"login":"shirese","id":9283400,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODM0MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283400?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese","html_url":"https://github.com/shirese","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shirese/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-10-21T18:17:45Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T20:23:52Z","closed_at":"2025-10-21T18:45:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.5.stable, 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS 15.6 - Godot 4.5.stable - M1 Pro\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen an exported variable (@export var) in a Resource subclass has a setter function, the value assigned in the inspector is applied at load (the setter is called), but the stored value resets to the variable’s default after deserialization.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new script test_resource.gd:\nclass_name TestResource\nextends Resource\n\n@export var value_without_setter: float = 1.0\n\n@export var value_with_setter: float = 1.0:\n    set(v):\n        print(\"Set value \", v)\n\n2. Create a new Node2D script:\nextends Node2D\n@export var test_resource: TestResource\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    print(\"Value without setter -> \", test_resource.value_without_setter)\n    print(\"Value with setter -> \", test_resource.value_with_setter)\n\n3. In the inspector:\nAssign a new TestResource to test_resource\nSet both values to 42.0\n\n4. Run the scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[resource-serialization-debug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23028264/resource-serialization-debug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi